[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0010","text":"好冷好冷好冷……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0020","text":"！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0030","text":"（“热乎乎的”……全军覆没……！？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0040","text":"（啊啊——对啊今天好冷嘛……！\n　大家都会想喝热饮的对吧……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0050","text":"（刚才去趟便利店就好了……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0060","text":"──辛苦了，智代子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0070","text":"！\n辛苦了，制作人──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0080","text":"那边卖完了啊\n不介意的话来点？热茶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0090","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000400_03_0100","text":"制作人，您是救世主吗……！？"}]
